# Only the editor's code and the chat history go to git - everything else stays on this computer.
# Never in git: config.json (logins, tokens, keys), ssl/ (certificate private key), sessions-log.json, Projects/,
# Recycle Bin/, footage, models, tools (FFmpeg), node_modules, logs, backups, the raw chat exports (.zip).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/server.mjs
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/CLAUDE.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/Start Video Editor.bat
!/Limelight Editor (tray).vbs
!/engine/
!/public/
!/tests/
!/Chats/
/Chats/*
!/Chats/*.md
!/Chats/LINKS.txt
# (the helper PCs' launcher - copied to Z:\Limelight Render Farm; tools/ itself holds FFmpeg and models)
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/farm/
*.zip
*.log
